'''Team Poképals''' (Japanese: '''ポケダンズ''' ''Pokédans'') is the main {{OBP|team|Mystery Dungeon}} in the animated specials ''[[Pokémon Mystery Dungeon: Explorers of Time & Darkness]]'' and ''[[Pokémon Mystery Dungeon: Explorers of Sky - Beyond Time & Darkness]]''.

==History==
The two main Pokémon of the team are {{p|Piplup}} and {{p|Chimchar}}. Piplup, however, is a [[human]] who was turned into a Pokémon, and was at first reluctant to be in an exploration team.

Although not part of Team Poképals, {{mdc|Sunflora|2}} from the Wigglytuff Guild accompanied them on their first mission in Pokémon Mystery Dungeon: Explorers of Time and Darkness. Team Poképals also appeared alongside {{mdc|Grovyle|2}} in ''Pokémon Mystery Dungeon: Explorers of the Sky - Beyond Time and Darkness'', heading for [[Temporal Tower]] to face [[Primal Dialga]].

