==Trivia==
* The name Poképals is the default name for the {{player}}'s team in {{g|Mystery Dungeon: Explorers of Time and Explorers of Darkness}} and {{g|Mystery Dungeon: Explorers of Sky}}.
** Likewise, in the Japanese version of the games, the name Pokédans (ポケダンズ) is the default name.
* {{p|Turtwig}} is the only [[Sinnoh first partner Pokémon]] that isn't in Team Poképals.
** However, one {{OBP|Pokémon Mystery Dungeon: Explorers of Time and Darkness|manga|special manga}} featured Chimchar and Turtwig as his partner.

